# Food for Thought (windurst 14): the three items before the order at another RNG position, with Kerutoto done but
# Kenapa not (kerutotoProg 2, kenapaProg 0: the guard's second half false): Ohbiru's finish marks ohbiruProg 3, no
# completion; then his 324, and a second set is not taken (ohbiruProg 3: nil). A Kenapa talk at kenapaProg 3 (GM) draws
# once first, so the trade's randomInt(1, 100) takes the other side of the 325 / 326 draw from `#early_ohbiru`.
lists WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrade WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/320 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/325 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/326
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=24.0,-5.38,-197.7
quest Windurst.FoodForThought accepted
charvar Quest[2][14]kerutotoProg 2
charvar Quest[2][14]kenapaProg 3
item CupOfWindurstianTea x2
item Tortilla x2
item ClumpOfPamtamKelp x2
login
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # kenapaProg 3: one draw, randomInt(1, 3): 320, 321 or 328
finish
charvar Quest[2][14]kenapaProg 0        # a GM puts kenapaProg back to 0
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 0 (< 2): 316 (0, 4493, 624, 4408), no draw
finish                                  # ohbiruProg 2
charvar Quest[2][14]ohbiruProg 1        # a GM puts ohbiruProg back under 2
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru CupOfWindurstianTea x1 Tortilla x1 ClumpOfPamtamKelp x1  # ohbiruProg 1: 325 (440) or 326
finish                                  # taken, +440 gil; kenapaProg 0: ohbiruProg 3
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 3: 324
finish
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru CupOfWindurstianTea x1 Tortilla x1 ClumpOfPamtamKelp x1  # the three again, ohbiruProg 3: nil, kept
